  "goodToKnow": "Der Grundbesitzer is a landowner: ein Großgrundbesitzer (large landowner), like the Prussian Junker estates east of the Elbe, expropriated in the Soviet zone after 1945. Der Grundbesitz is landed property, and der Grund means land as well as reason. Owners pay Grundsteuer, recalculated under a reform from 2025. The plural is the same."
